  "title": {
   "en": "Yuusha ni Uragirareta Tensei Chiyuushi ga Maou no Chouki ni Naru Made"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "勇者に裏切られた転生治癒士が魔王の寵姫になるまで"
   },
   {
    "ja": "勇者に裏切られた転生治癒士〈ヒーラー〉が魔王の寵姫になるまで"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Yuusha ni Uragirareta Tensei Chiyuushi (Healer) ga Maou no Chouki ni Naru Made"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reincarnated Healer Betrayed by the Hero Is the Demon Lord's Beloved"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Alicia, who was reincarnated into a different world and raised there as an orphan, had been engaged to her childhood friend Chris. But after becoming the Hero, Chris falls in love with the saintly Princess Irene at first sight. Then giving into the princess's temptation, he ends up stabbing Alicia. Alicia is both literally and figuratively brokenhearted by this betrayal, but who should come to save her but the Demon King himself, even though she had always thought of him as the enemy...",
   "ja": "お前は私に捧げられた花嫁だ\n\n転生し孤児として異世界で育ったアリシアは、幼馴染のクリスと婚約をしていた。\nしかし勇者になったクリスが聖女イレーネ姫に一目ぼれ。姫の誘惑に負け、アリシアを刺してしまう。\n失意のアリシアを助けたのは敵だったはずの魔王で―…。"
  },
